╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                     REGISTRY DESCRIPTOR RECORD SHEET                        ║
║                              AE6E66.RDRS                                    ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Module:          AE6E66                                                     ║
║ Full Name:       UK Parliament Contact Module                               ║
║ Author:          Max Rupplin — MEARVK LLC                                  ║
║ Version:         2.0 hardened baseline                                      ║
║ Status:          Security-hardened; deployment verification required         ║
║ Path:            modules/AE6E66/                                            ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ PURPOSE                                                                      ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Collect publicly available UK Parliament contact information for a declared  ║
║ operational purpose, with provenance, bounded collection, explicit operator ║
║ control, and fail-closed integrity.                                         ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ COLLECTION                                                                   ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ HTTPS:             Required                                                 ║
║ Timeouts:          Required                                                 ║
║ Response limits:   Required                                                 ║
║ Concurrency:       Bounded                                                  ║
║ Rate limiting:     Required                                                 ║
║ Source provenance: Required per record                                      ║
║ Identifier ranges: Not an authorization mechanism                            ║
║ Content trust:     Remote HTML/images treated as untrusted input            ║
║ Data minimization: Required                                                 ║
║                                                                              ║
║ Collection must respect applicable access controls, terms, robots guidance, ║
║ and rate limits. Prefer authoritative indexes/APIs over brute-force ranges. ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ MAIL                                                                         ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Architecture:       AE6E66 -> local submission -> admin MTA -> recipient MX ║
║ Public SMTP:        Disabled by module                                      ║
║ Auto-install MTA:   Disabled                                                ║
║ Open relay:         Must be rejected                                        ║
║ TLS:                Modern platform/MTA policy required                     ║
║ DKIM:               Administrator-managed, protected private key             ║
║ SPF/DMARC:          Must match actual deployment identity                   ║
║ Rate limiting:      Explicit and operator-controlled                        ║
║                                                                              ║
║ Historical hard-coded host/domain/IP/from values are not defaults.          ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ DATABASE                                                                     ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Account:            Local-only service account                              ║
║ Privilege:          Minimum required application permissions                ║
║ Credentials:        OS secret store / protected runtime only                ║
║ Git credentials:    Prohibited                                               ║
║ Schema changes:     Explicit administrator-controlled migration              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ INTEGRITY                                                                    ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Algorithm:          SHA-256                                                 ║
║ MD5:                Not used for security decisions                         ║
║ Verification:       Mandatory before execution                              ║
║ Failure behavior:   FAIL CLOSED                                             ║
║ Auto-restore:       Disabled                                                ║
║ Trust anchor:       Pinned approved commit/release                          ║
║ Diagnostics:        Integrity verification precedes diagnostics              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ PRIVILEGE                                                                     ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ Package install:    Not performed by module baseline                        ║
║ DNS changes:        Not performed                                           ║
║ Firewall changes:   Not performed                                           ║
║ Network binding:   Not performed                                           ║
║ Service enablement: Not performed                                           ║
║ Sudo:               Explicit administrator action only                      ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ DATA                                                                         ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ contacts.csv:       Controlled public-source data                            ║
║ Provenance:         Required                                                 ║
║ Retention:          Configurable and documented                              ║
║ Private data:       Do not add merely because discoverable                  ║
║ Logs:               No credentials or unnecessary sensitive content          ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ FILES                                                                         ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ README.md                         Human-readable module documentation         ║
║ SECURITY.md                       Security and data-protection standard       ║
║ DEPLOYMENT.md                     Safe deployment architecture               ║
║ configuration/ae6e66-config.example.xml  Secret-free configuration template ║
║ scripts/verify-integrity.sh       SHA-256 fail-closed verifier               ║
║ scripts/install-postfix-dovecot.sh MTA preflight only                       ║
║ scripts/setup-dkim-lauradei.sh    DKIM/MTA preflight only                    ║
║ scripts/setup-mysql.sh            Database preflight only                    ║
║ contacts.csv                      Controlled public contact dataset            ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ OPERATING RULE                                                               ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ If integrity, provenance, authorization, or required security configuration  ║
║ cannot be established, AE6E66 stops rather than guessing.                    ║
